<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN CORONA-LOTUS 1996 PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN CORONA-LOTUS 1996 PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit		     116  vs   100</p>
<p>    Cons turnover (billions)	  3.08  vs  2.97</p>
<p>    Net dividend			    37  vs    35</p>
<p>NOTE - Corona-Lotus NV is a Belgian biscuit manufacturer.</p>
<p>In a statement, Corona-Lotus said it expected both net and</p>
<p>current profit to improve slightly in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax</p>
<p>+32 2 230 7710</p>
